								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I&#039;ve only banned that terie chick, wow.. <br /><br />But I&#039;ve never banned anyone but her, you have a board account on the new ones? I don&#039;t care really one way or another, but the security holes in the old board software we used was the more likely way alot of people found thier way in. I really don&#039;t like vBulletin. High priced software with bugs... ick.<br /><br />I wasn&#039;t sure how you guys handled new stuff Jeet.I know we had about a total of 10 uqua raids before we won. I probably focused too much in gearing up, but overall, I&#039;d say alot of the members did not mind so much. <br /><br />Different guilds approach different targets with different angles based on guild make up etc... If I would say FoT has any biggest weakness, it&#039;s aggro control by certain people. Which in uqua is fatal. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
